Package: xenon-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: unattended-upgrades
Description: Xenon update repository and signing key
 Points APT at Xenon's update repository, trusts only Xenon's signing
 key for it, and lets unattended-upgrades install Xenon updates
 automatically in the background.
